2. च्यु cl. 1. च्य॑वते (ep. also ˚ति; Subj. 1. sg. च्य॑वम्, RV. i, 165, 10; 3. pl. च्यवन्त, 48, 2 fut. च्योष्यते, AitBr. ii, 22; aor. 2. pl. अच्योढ्वम् [Subj. च्य्˚, MahānārUp.] and Prec. च्योषीढ्वम्, Pāṇ. viii, 3, 78, Kāś.) to move to and fro, shake about, RV. i, 167, 8;
to stir, move from one's place, go away, retire from (abl.), turn off; vi, 62, 7;
 x; BhP. ix, 14, 20;
to deviate from (abl.), abandon (duty &c., abl.; exceptionally gen., MBh. xv, 463 [C] inf. च्यवितुम्), Mn. vii, 98; MBh. iii;
